Depot world and model provenance
===============================

World template:
  https://github.com/turtlebot/turtlebot4_simulator/blob/0ea4a60c51e49ed4a9e25b4f9971ff0f0c9a08fe/turtlebot4_ignition_bringup/worlds/depot.sdf
  License: Apache-2.0; see LICENSE in this directory.
  Changes in worlds/depot.sdf: resolve the bundled model with model://depot;
  add Ogre2 Sensors and Imu systems for this workspace's robot sensors.
  Add a separate static collision model using the original wall, pillar,
  stair, box and crate meshes at their original visual scale (0.6).
  The upstream model itself only defines a ground-plane collision.

Depot model:
  Owner: OpenRobotics.
  Authors (model.config): Rafi Abdullah and Louise Poubel, Open Robotics.
  Source: https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/Depot
  Pinned version: 6.
  Archive: https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/Depot/6/Depot.zip
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  See LICENSE.depot for the license text.
  Model files, meshes and materials are redistributed without modification.
  Assets were downloaded individually as a model archive; no repository was cloned.
